# Edge Function secrets for LOCAL development only (`npx supabase functions serve`).
# Copy to supabase/functions/.env — it is gitignored, never commit it.
# In production set it with: npx supabase secrets set GOOGLE_SAFE_BROWSING_API_KEY=...
# This key must NEVER go in the app's .env or any EXPO_PUBLIC_ variable.
GOOGLE_SAFE_BROWSING_API_KEY=YOUR_GOOGLE_SAFE_BROWSING_API_KEY
# CoinGecko Demo API key for the token-lookup function (free: https://www.coingecko.com/en/api).
# In production: npx supabase secrets set COINGECKO_API_KEY=...
COINGECKO_API_KEY=YOUR_COINGECKO_DEMO_API_KEY
